<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Can LLMs Refuse Questions They Do Not Know? Measuring Knowledge-Aware Refusal in Factual Tasks</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
