<p id="A4.T6.3" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_top" style="width:190.8pt;"><span id="A4.T6.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Gaussian Win Rates</span>

<span id="A4.T6.3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
